<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay exports up 10.8 pct so far this year.</title>
<headline>Paraguay exports up 10.8 pct so far this year.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's exports rose 10.8 pct in the first nine months of the year from the same period in 1995, the customs office said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Exports totalled $716 million from January through September, up from $645.9 million in the 1995 period.</p>
<p>Exports in September were $43.6 million, down from $61.1 million in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Import data was unavailable.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarillla, Asuncion Newsroom 595 21 444527</p>
